# Build-context filter for packaging/oci/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile
# in preference to the root .dockerignore, which the context root would otherwise use).
# Allow-list: exclude everything at the repository root, then add back only what the image build reads.

*

!global.json
!NuGet.config
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!src

# Client projects are not part of the server image.
src/Bazaar.Client.*

# Build output, IDE state and local artefacts, anywhere under src.
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/*.user
**/TestResults

# Never ship local secret material, even if a file lands under src.
**/secrets
**/*.env
**/appsettings.Development.json
